    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing its wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Blade poles model selection logic, not physical terminals. Generic series humbuckers omit lead colors, polarity, and values; bridge ground, cable, and load omitted. Red/white joins are coil links; no bridge terminal exists. Pots use logical lugs and a linear scale, not audio taper. Two volumes exceed the one-master-volume limit, so the analyzer returns unavailable."
